Package: mintbin-m68k-atari-mint
Section: devel
Architecture: any
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: binutils-m68k-atari-mint, gcc-m68k-atari-mint
Description: Additional binary utilities that support Atari MiNT executables.
 The programs in this package are used to manipulate executable files for the
 Atari MiNT operating system. This package is primarily for Atari MiNT
 developers and is not needed by normal users or developers.
